  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Eight rays of light flash from you in a 60-foot Cone. Each creature in the Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw. For each target, roll 1d8 to determine which color ray affects it:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><td>d8</td><td>Ray</td><td>Effect</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Red</td><td>12d6 Fire damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Orange</td><td>12d6 Acid damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Yellow</td><td>12d6 Lightning damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Green</td><td>12d6 Poison damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Blue</td><td>12d6 Cold damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Indigo</td><td>Restrained; CON saves to end or become Petrified</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Violet</td><td>Blinded; WIS save or teleported to another plane</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Special</td><td>Struck by two rays (roll 1d7 twice)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>midi-qol automation</strong>: Fully automated. The DEX save determines hit/half damage. The ItemMacro rolls 1d8 per target to assign rays. Damage rays (1–5) deal 12d6 of the appropriate type (half on save). Roll 8 assigns two rays via 1d7 each. Indigo (6) applies Restrained with OverTime CON saves — 3 successes end the effect, 3 failures apply Petrified permanently. Violet (7) applies Blinded with an OverTime WIS save — success ends blindness, failure means teleportation to another plane (DM adjudicates destination).</p>",
      "chat": "<p>Eight rays of light flash from you in a 60-foot Cone. Each creature in the Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw. For each target, roll 1d8 to determine which color ray affects it:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><td>d8</td><td>Ray</td><td>Effect</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Red</td><td>12d6 Fire damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Orange</td><td>12d6 Acid damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Yellow</td><td>12d6 Lightning damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Green</td><td>12d6 Poison damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Blue</td><td>12d6 Cold damage (half on save)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Indigo</td><td>Restrained; CON saves to end or become Petrified</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Violet</td><td>Blinded; WIS save or teleported to another plane</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Special</td><td>Struck by two rays (roll 1d7 twice)</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    "source": {
      "custom": "midi-qol sample",
      "rules": "2024"
    },
